Provenance
---------------------------------------------------------------------------

This project is a derivative work. The split-flap rendering engine — the tile
animation, the flap audio, the visual design — originates from FlipOff by
magnum6actual, released under the MIT license per that project's README
("MIT — do whatever you want with it"). That repository ships no LICENSE file,
so the MIT notice is reproduced here on its behalf in LICENSE-MIT.

Upstream, kept essentially unchanged (MIT only):

    static/js/Board.js
    static/js/Tile.js
    static/js/MessageRotator.js
    static/js/flapAudio.js
    static/js/SoundEngine.js
    static/js/KeyboardController.js
    static/css/*

    static/js/constants.js  — modified: grid dimensions and messages are read
                              at runtime from the backend rather than being
                              hardcoded.

Added by this project (Apache-2.0 OR MIT, at your option):

    app/                    FastAPI backend, admin UI, persistent state
    static/js/kiosk-main.js backend-driven bootstrap
    Dockerfile
    docker-compose.yml
    openapi.json
